{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31407","headline":"百官乘月早朝听残漏 · 莫宣卿","name":"百官乘月早朝听残漏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"建礼俨朝冠，重门耿夜阑。\n碧空蟾魄度，清禁漏声残。\n候晓车舆合，凌霜剑佩寒。\n星河犹皎皎，银箭尚珊珊。\n杳霭祥光起，霏微瑞气攒。\n忻逢圣明代，长愿接鵷鸾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"莫宣卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}